B.abP=new A.i(1010,"caution","RED FLAG - Thyroid storm - a life-threatening complication of untreated/undertreated hyperthyroidism with a mortality rate around 16% in patients over 60 - requires immediate recognition and urgent (emergency/ICU-level) management.")
B.abt=new A.i(1189,"peds_note",u.X9)
B.a6v=new A.i(1314,"peds_note",u.Ds)
B.a9_=new A.i(1517,"caution","RED FLAG - The GCA (giant cell arteritis) red flags requiring urgent evaluation are new headache, visual or jaw symptoms, temporal artery tenderness or pulse loss, persistent inflammatory markers, high-grade fever, and refractory symptoms.")
