B.aC7=new A.l("precocious-puberty","Triptorelin","Confirmed central precocious puberty: specialist, product-specific depot regimen; weight/injection dates determine dosing. Do not substitute depot formulations.","injection",'GONAPEPTYL DEPOT 3.75 mg Powder and solvent for suspension for injection - Summary of Product Characteristics, eMC product 2229, sections 4.1 and 4.2 - https://www.medicines.org.uk/emc/product/2229/smpc - verbatim: "Dosing at the beginning of treatment should be based on body weight, one injection of triptorelin should be injected on days 0, 14, and 28. Thereafter one injection every 4 weeks. Should the effect be insufficient, the injections may be given every 3 weeks." The licensed indication, section 4.1 - verbatim: "Treatment of confirmed central precocious puberty (girls under 9 years, boys under 10 years)".',"GnRH analogue depot - a paediatric endocrinologist starts it","Not applicable - central precocious puberty is treated in childhood (see the paediatric dose)","Repeated every 4 weeks until bone maturation passes 12 years in a girl or 13 years in a boy",u.SU)
