B.axU=new A.l("routine-immunisation-catch-up","BCG vaccine","BCG intradermal once: <1 year 0.05 mL; >1 year 0.1 mL. Manufacturer diluent only; use within 6 h. Exact age-1/birth timing needs clarification.","injection",'MSF Essential Drugs 2024 (TUBERCULOSIS VACCINE = BCG VACCINE monograph, p549) - verbatim: "Child: 0.05 ml single dose as soon after birth as possible If child is over one year old: 0.1 ml single dose"; the age is Egypt\'s own, from WHO/UNICEF national immunisation schedule for Egypt, 2025 (WHO Immunization Data portal, WIISE AD_SCHEDULES, data/reference/library/who-egypt-immunisation-schedule-2025.txt), which places BCG round 1 at birth; the Ministry of Health and Population timetable places it in the first month instead, and that difference is unresolved.',"Tuberculosis","0.05 mL as a single intradermal injection into the external face of the left upper arm; 0.1 mL if the child is over one year old","One dose, as soon after birth as possible",u.q6)
