B.awO=new A.b2("Postinfectious cough: no benefit from inhaled steroids, bronchodilators or oral medicines.",!1)
B.ax0=new A.b2("Keep the child away from tobacco smoke.",!1)
B.awp=new A.b2("Menthol/camphor/eucalyptus rubs may ease cough/congestion but can irritate skin, eyes and nose.",!1)
B.aws=new A.b2("Fever/discomfort only; omit if comfortable.",!0)
B.awQ=new A.b2("Recognise possible abuse; assess/treat injuries and provide objective medical information. Do not assign blame or try to prove maltreatment.",!0)
B.ax6=new A.b2("Prevent recurrent UTI: ask about constipation, daytime wetting and withholding; treat bowel/bladder dysfunction. Hydrate; void every 3-4 hours. Cranberry prevention lacks evidence.",!0)
B.awe=new A.b2("Physiological short stature: medically well. Constitutional delay usually needs reassurance; familial short stature needs realistic expectations and explanation that no disease underlies it.",!0)
